---
_type: PltConcept
_label: 'Derivable evaluation statement judgement'
journey: fref("/01-programming-language-theory/index.td")
status: 'learning'
---

An ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/evaluation-statement-judgement.td")} is derivable if there is a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/derivation-tree.td")} conforming to the evaluation relation whose root is that evaluation statement.
